{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_st03",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_st03",
  "title": "壓力之下",
  "storyCode": "OF-ST3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d8655555a835de0566de52ed61879d3116a583854687434a4fe3af34b22a61a1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可以陪我逛逛嗎，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我有些擔心你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你知道嗎，我小的時候，這片沙灘沒有這麼多人的。我很喜歡一個人在那裡堆沙子城堡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這座城市在我父親的治理下，每一年都在變得更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和我的父親，該怎麼說呢，話並不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在想，是不是比起跟我多說說話，城市和賺錢對他才更重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "母親在生我的時候就去世了，我有時候也會想是不是因為這樣，他才不喜歡我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仿佛也不在乎我喜不喜歡他，自我記事起，他就經常不在家裡。與其說是父女，更像是住在同一座房子裡的陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑，我要出門去觀察海邊的生態！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，小姐，老爺吩咐過，不能隨便出門的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可家裡的書我已經看膩了！黑你又一點也不好玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，小姐。這也是為了您的安全著想，外面是很危險的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是有你在嗎，難道你會讓我身處危險嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那自然是肯定不會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那還有什麼問題？我們走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那麼，請您絕對不要離開我的視線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sunnytown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以說，黑在我的身邊這件事，對我來說，是我的生活中最理所當然不過的一部分了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sunnytown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快點，這批裝飾是今晚的LIVE要用到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男市民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是趕不上了可就麻煩了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那個人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒記錯的話，是第二大道那家“知更鳥咖啡店”的店主爺爺的孫子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡是我以前常去的地方，店主爺爺很和藹。店裡裝飾著他去世的妻子奇幻的花和盆栽，放著他們以前一起喜歡的音樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說來，他確實說過，身體不行了，要把店傳給孫子了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時間過得真快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我得了礦石病，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靠近我對您的身體不好，您只要在需要的時候叫我就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什麼，很痛嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不會很痛，但是，會死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種病是治不了的，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我偏要把它治好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你等著吧！將來有一天，我會把它給打敗，然後把黑從它手裡搶回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sunnytown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會想要研究源石，也是因為她是感染者，我想要把她治好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是一直以來支持我的動力啊，為了這個夢想，我可是去了維多利亞讀書欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晦澀難懂的源石研究，我一開始完全搞不懂，好幾次都想放棄了，最後還是堅持了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維多利亞也好遠啊，本來我一開始還完全不習慣那裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果到了現在，我與其說是一個汐斯塔人，不如說是一個維多利亞人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，難道說，我所擁有的一切，都是假的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了守護這裡，我可以付出很多東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我也不知道。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "錫蘭",
              "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......呼。是啊，博士又怎麼會知道呢。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "她說不定也有苦衷。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "錫蘭",
              "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "有什麼苦衷，連我也不能告訴嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "錫蘭",
              "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "而且，無論有什麼樣的苦衷，做了壞事就是做了壞事，這是無法回避的。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你說，我應該放棄嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我很難就這件事給你答案......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但是我知道的是，你也是研究源石的學者。",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我們能戰勝礦石病嗎？\n我們能拯救礦石病人嗎？\n這災難會有盡頭嗎？\n我看不到盡頭。我沒有把握。我不知道答案。\n我可以放棄嗎？可以。\n但我不願意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這片大地也許很糟......",
          "value": "5",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但你做的一切，並不是徒勞的。",
          "value": "6",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "相信你自己的選擇。",
          "value": "7",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呼。你說得對，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不愧是前輩，我在這方面看來要學習的還有許多呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我要做的，不是坐在這裡胡思亂想，而是取證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他們真的是會放任市民們陷入危機的話，我一定會盡我的全力去阻止他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且既然我相信自己絕對是正確的，即使是只有我一個人，我也會為了拯救這個城市而努力的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說的不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，赫拉格爺爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，心情收拾得還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。赫拉格爺爺，博士，你們能聽我說嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼樣，我也不希望讓汐斯塔市的人們陷入危險。對我來說這個才是最為優先的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在加里森遊樂場的旁邊有著全市最大的廣播塔，全城市的廣播系統都是在那裡運行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廣播塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，那裡也是克洛寧管轄的區域。他也常常在面向全市的廣播中露面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁著LIVE開始的時候，人群集中起來，克洛寧的人也難免應接不暇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要我們能在那個時候控制電台，就能向全城的人傳遞火山的情報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以拜託你們了，請助我一臂之力吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
